#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""PiFin settings daemon: the only writer of the settings store.

Runs as root. The TV app and the phone server (user pifin) read
/var/lib/pifin/settings.json directly and change it only through the Unix socket
/run/pifin/settings.sock: one JSON object per line in, one per line out.
It also keeps the legacy files other scripts read (app.conf, display.conf,
secrets.env, comitup.conf, auth.json) in sync.

No shell anywhere: every system command goes through RUN (an argument list with a
timeout), which the tests replace. Every path is under PIFIN_ROOT (tests only).
Never log a PIN, a password, a key or a token.
"""
